        "TileImage": "$($repository f8736788-3a81-49ce-872d-87c06dd7ce08).Image",
        "Description": "Looks like Jeff&#39;s in for another lonely holiday season.\r\rEver since the tragic death of his beloved Rebecca in Bangkok, Jeff has never properly adjusted to his newfound widower life. There were some perks, sure, like being able to bring his trusty propane tanks around, and giving him a new appreciation for his own life.\r\rThe problem is his empty bed sheets, where love has faded.\r\rHe&#39;s attempted to make friends to keep him company, but there&#39;s three losers preventing him from doing so, from spreading lies to outright framing him for things he didn&#39;t do.\r\rIf there&#39;s one thing Jeff hates more than loneliness, it&#39;s lying. It should be a silent night for the silent assassins.\r\rGive the trio a sayonara from him.",
        "GameVersion": "8.14.0.59",
